OL,3,GNEWSA'Trying time' for runners over
OL,4,Atrack revamp delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorks to improve an ageing athletics
OL,7,Ffacility at a school were stopped in
OL,8,Ftheir tracks due to "unforeseen and
OL,9,Fcomplex issues" but could resume next
OL,10,Fyear, the BBC understands.
OL,12,FIn January, Suffolk County Council
OL,13,Fpledged to invest #350,000 in Northgate
OL,14,FSports Centre in Ipswich, which has
OL,15,Fbeen run by Northgate High School since
OL,16,FApril.
OL,18,FFunded through the council's Ipswich
OL,19,FInvestment Fund, the money was
OL,20,Fearmarked to improve the tired running
OL,21,Ftrack - which has not been resurfaced
OL,22,Ffor 25 years.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
