OL,3,GNEWSA'Trying time' for runners over
OL,4,Atrack revamp delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork was meant to get under way in the
OL,7,Fsummer, but the BBC has been told it
OL,8,Fwas postponed after "technical
OL,9,Fdifficulties" were encountered at the
OL,10,Fstart. One athletics club has called it
OL,11,Fa "trying time".
